  "description": "Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this Merry Christmas clipart collection! This delightful set features an array of festive cartoon icons, including Santa Claus, his adorable elves, a red-nose reindeer, and a snowman. It also includes classic holiday elements like gingerbread man cookies, candy canes, Christmas trees, gift boxes and more.\nWhether you’re creating holiday cards, social media posts, gift tags, invitations, decorations, or sticker sheets, this versatile clipart bundle offers everything you need to bring warmth and cheer to your designs. Let your imagination shine and make every project sparkle with this enchanting collection that’s perfect for spreading holiday joy!\nInclusions:\n• 50 PNG files with transparent background\n• 3000px width\n• 300 DPI high-quality resolution\nNotes:\n• All files come in a zipped folder.\n• Actual graphic assets do not contain watermarks.\n• Colors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this Merry Christmas clipart collection! This delightful set features an array of festive cartoon icons, including Santa Claus, his adorable elves, a red-nose reindeer, and a snowman. It also includes classic holiday elements like gingerbread man cookies, candy canes, Christmas trees, gift boxes and more.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating holiday cards, social media posts, gift tags, invitations, decorations, or sticker sheets, this versatile clipart bundle offers everything you need to bring warmth and cheer to your designs. Let your imagination shine and make every project sparkle with this enchanting collection that’s perfect for spreading holiday joy!</p>\n<p>Inclusions:<br>\n• 50 PNG files with transparent background<br>\n• 3000px width<br>\n• 300 DPI high-quality resolution</p>\n<p>Notes:<br>\n• All files come in a zipped folder.<br>\n• Actual graphic assets do not contain watermarks.<br>\n• Colors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and printer settings.</p>",
